      "data": {
        "text": "\"Task specifications (listed alphabetically; implement only the requested file):\ncorpus_safety.py - Check corpus text before embedding\nembed_batch.py - generates embeddings for a batch of texts\nembed_for_search.py - embeds a query and documents for semantic search\nembed_text.py - generates an embedding vector for one text string\nembedding_job_summary.py - Summarize embedding job results\nembeddings_client.py - Provide local configuration and client helper utilities for Direct Embeddings API\nembeddings_models.py - Define local request, response, and normalization helpers for Direct Embeddings API\nmultilingual_query_translate.py - Translate queries before multilingual embedding search\nretrieval_audio_brief.py - Generate a spoken brief from retrieved search results\nsimilarity_score.py - computes cosine similarity between two embedded texts\n\nCreate similarity_score.py in the current working directory.\nTask: computes cosine similarity between two embedded texts.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
