    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `similarity_score.py` that computes cosine similarity between two embedded texts using a concrete external provider, I will use the Hugging Face Transformers library, which is a popular and widely used provider for natural language processing tasks. This library provides pre-trained models and utilities for various NLP tasks, including computing cosine similarity between embeddings. I will import the necessary modules from the Hugging Face Transformers library and use them to compute the cosine similarity. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789889489830,
          "start": 1789889486182
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bdba1d66001rK32xIFui094eP",
      "message_id": "msg_0bdba18b8001lyl6JrFiWy6Rtx",
      "session_id": "ses_f4245e753ffeiNvLd2Wa62KgAh",
