        "text": "<thinking> To create the `embed_batch.py` file that generates embeddings for a batch of texts using a concrete external provider, I will choose Amazon Bedrock as the provider. This choice is based on its robust capabilities for generating embeddings. The code will import the necessary modules from the Amazon Bedrock SDK and use the specific model identifier to generate embeddings for a batch of texts. </thinking>\n",
